Subject: [mistral.rs] reasoning-channels-assembled-in-template

  A reasoning format whose channel delimiters the template assembles from markers instead of writing literally, so neither the tag detector nor the parser can be driven off the delimiters themselves (Kimi K3).

Applies to: 962112d18ea5729fe7acaae5085ce54c2fb66dab
Files: 3

